cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this package, please cite both the package and the methods paper it implements."
title: "reiof: Dietary Environmental Impact Metrics from the Intake EIOF Framework"
abstract: >-
  An R implementation of the absolute threshold, relative benchmark and
  composite dietary environmental impact metrics defined in Intake's
  Environmental Impacts of Foods methods paper. The package implements the
  published metric cut-offs; it does not contain the Environmental Impacts of
  Foods database.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Nicholus Tint"
    family-names: "Zaw"
    email: "n.t.zaw@cgiar.org"
version: 0.0.0.9000
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/nicholustintzaw/reiof"
url: "https://nicholustintzaw.github.io/reiof/"
keywords:
  - dietary assessment
  - environmental impact
  - planetary health
  - sustainable diets
  - food systems
references:
  - type: report
    title: "Methods for Assessing Healthy, Environmentally Sustainable Diets Globally"
    authors:
      - name: "Intake - Center for Dietary Assessment"
    year: 2026
    notes: "Source of the metric definitions and cut-offs implemented by this package."
